# Task: synthetic eight-expert GLM-5.2 PD

Finish operational smoke and one 4096-input/1024-output CONC32 benchmark on 138(prefill)+136(decode), four GPUs per leg, TP4/DP4/DPA on/EP4. Physically keep only eight routed experts per layer, always select all eight. Preserve the shared expert and attention/KV geometry. Mission authority: spec/mission.md.

## Background
The goal is to free actual weight VRAM for KV cache, not preserve model quality. MTP and HiCache OFF were explicitly selected by the user for this round. No simulated acceptance. Results are synthetic, never original GLM-5.2 performance.

